{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wY2MBRHB391793094554.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>泡泡瑪特上季多個市場的收益都錄得跌幅。</p><p></p><p>整體收益第三季，按年下跌四成半至五成。當中，中國跌兩成半至三成。亞太區至少跌六成半。美洲至少跌七成。</p><p></p><p>歐洲及其他地區收益下跌五成至五成半。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:02.763082+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:44.770158+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:27.539581+00:00","content_hash":"d6b88c66e91d65a26bc136970838462c870892a7fb1d78dd340e8e4f592220e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:02.763082+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}